OL,3,GNEWSASolar power plans for Royal &
OL,4,ADerngate theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town centre theatre could have most
OL,7,Fof its energy needs met by on-site
OL,8,Fsolar power, if planning permission is
OL,9,Fgranted.
OL,11,FThe application for major roof works at
OL,12,Fthe Royal & Derngate theatre in
OL,13,FNorthampton is being considered by West
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Council (WNC).
OL,16,FThe council owns the building ` but not
OL,17,Fthe theatre business ` and hopes to
OL,18,Finstall 232 rooftop solar panels at the
OL,19,Fsame time as fixing a leaky roof.
